  "sourceChain": [
    "Native NavigationStarting marks ready=false and protocol.setInputEnabled(false). Protocol toggles call releaseInputs and increment cancelSeq on both disable/enable.",
    "Document-start Windows bridge receives disabled snapshot before game scripts exist. This initial seed alone does not produce the pause in the actual-source fixture.",
    "Host foreground() executes JoystickDesktop.suspend() whenever !active (including !ready); the shared input also suspends for actual blur/hidden and calls onCancel for a changed connected cancelSeq.",
    "Backroad cancel() clears controls, sets pendingPause; if not ready it remains pending until original StageMenus becomes ready, then calls the original pause menu.",
    "Both original final states are ready + paused + intro + resume focus, with native/document epoch2, correct query, keys released and no START count. A later cancel path is consistent with this state but the original trace lacks the exact triggering event."
  ],
